  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "二值化策略",
      "items": [
        "HybridBinarizer 把图切成 8x8 块、按 5x5 邻域算局部阈值，小图回退 GlobalHistogramBinarizer",
        "BinaryBitmap.getBlackMatrix 首次请求才真正二值化并缓存，避免 1D Reader 命中时做无用功"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "失败与分支",
      "items": [
        "带上 PURE_BARCODE hint 时，QRCodeReader 用 extractPureBits 直接从黑白边界推算模块，跳过 Detector",
        "任何 Reader 抛 ReaderException 时 decodeInternal 换下一个 Reader；ALSO_INVERTED 会翻转整块矩阵再试一轮"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "编码侧对照",
      "items": [
        "MultiFormatWriter 按 BarcodeFormat switch 出具体 Writer，encode 的返回值同样是 BitMatrix",
        "解码与编码共用 BitMatrix，所以 QRCodeWriter 生成的矩阵可以直接回灌 Decoder 做自测"
      ]
    }
  ]
}